Sand Dog was added in '''Beta 39.1''', but was already buffed in '''Beta 40.0'''. Before, it was an 11G Taunt that would summon a 0/1 copy of itself, which gained +1/+1 for each [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Dog Dog] in your hand. Now, not only did its cost drop by 1G, the copy will gain an extra 1 HP for each Dog in your hand. '''Beta 41.0''' changed it again. It lost Taunt and its cost returned to 11G, but the copy will now gain -4/-7 instead of always being 0/1, so prior stat changes (through things like [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Space_Cooler Space Cooler] and [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Inflation Inflation]) will now be copied over as well.

